Description: Provides modern, interactive visualizations for *xcms*
    metabolomics data results using *ggplot2*. This package implements
    *ggplot2* versions of *xcms* plotting functions, enabling interactive
    plots through *plotly* and consistent visualization styling. Designed as
    a parallel package to *xcms*, maintaining compatibility with both `XCMSnExp`
    and `XcmsExperiment` result objects and following *xcms* conventions for
    methods and object types. This package reuses and adapts substantial code
    and algorithms from the *xcms* package, translating base R graphics
    implementations to *ggplot2* while preserving the original visualization
    logic and functionality.
